{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Wildlings: Why is There a Zoo in Bazooka?",
    "steam_appid": 3221320,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildlings: Why is There a Zoo in Bazooka?</strong> is a punishing bazooka-platformer where you don\u2019t jump \u2014 you explode. You\u2019re an animal. Or several. You swap heads, swap bodies, and blast yourself through a single massive level full of pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aim with the mouse. You fire with the mouse. And then you deal with the consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast yourself with a bazooka to move. That\u2019s it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match heads and bodies of 3 animals. For no reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, fall, bounce, scream. In that order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular Mode (checkpoints, a lie)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Mode (no checkpoints, pure rage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single handcrafted level full of traps, fans, bounce pads, and regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack that slaps while you suffer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse only. No buttons. Just vibes and recoil.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll restart a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll scream a little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might even laugh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you make it to the end... well, we won\u2019t spoil what\u2019s there.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildlings: Why is There a Zoo in Bazooka?</strong> is a punishing bazooka-platformer where you don\u2019t jump \u2014 you explode. You\u2019re an animal. Or several. You swap heads, swap bodies, and blast yourself through a single massive level full of pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aim with the mouse. You fire with the mouse. And then you deal with the consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast yourself with a bazooka to move. That\u2019s it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match heads and bodies of 3 animals. For no reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, fall, bounce, scream. In that order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular Mode (checkpoints, a lie)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Mode (no checkpoints, pure rage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single handcrafted level full of traps, fans, bounce pads, and regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack that slaps while you suffer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse only. No buttons. Just vibes and recoil.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll restart a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll scream a little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might even laugh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you make it to the end... well, we won\u2019t spoil what\u2019s there.</p>",
    "short_description": "Blast yourself with a bazooka across one giant rage-filled level in this brutal physics platformer. Mix and match animal heads and bodies, master precision recoil, and survive deadly traps. No mercy. No jumps. Just you, a bazooka, and bad decisions.",
